    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Function.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Function</code></a> defines a custom aggregation\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/operator/aggregation/function/\">$function</a> in JavaScript.\n<br/>\n<code class=\"java\">\n{\n  $function: {\n    body: ...,\n    args: ...,\n    lang: \"js\"\n  }\n}\n</code> <br/>\n<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Function.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Function</code></a> cannot be used as part of <a href=\"../schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema</code></a> validation query expression. <br/>\n<b>NOTE:</b> <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/core/server-side-javascript/\">Server-Side JavaScript</a>\nexecution must be\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/configuration-options/#security.javascriptEnabled\">enabled</a>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Function.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Function</code></a> 定义了一个自定义聚合 <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/operator/aggregation/function/\">$function</a>，该函数使用 JavaScript 编写。\n<br/>\n<code class=\"java\">\n{\n  $function: {\n    body: ...,\n    args: ...,\n    lang: \"js\"\n  }\n}\n</code> <br/>\n<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Function.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Function</code></a> 不能作为 <a href=\"../schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema</code></a> 验证查询表达式的一部分使用。\n<br/>\n<b>注意：</b> 必须<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/configuration-options/#security.javascriptEnabled\">启用</a><a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/core/server-side-javascript/\">服务器端 JavaScript</a>执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"AggregationExpression.html#toDocument(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation.AggregationOperationContext)\">AggregationExpression</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"AggregationExpression.html#toDocument(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation.AggregationOperationContext)\">AggregationExpression</a></code></span>",
